Reverses the management schema offline, after making a new backup. Deletes its history

Usage: leptoskit console rollback-database [OPTIONS] --backup <BACKUP>

Options:
      --data <DATA>      
      --backup <BACKUP>  
      --yes              
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
